      "simplified": "端午节是中国的一个传统节日，起源于春秋之前的吴越之地，",
      "traditional": "端午節是中國的一個傳統節日，起源於春秋之前的吳越之地，",
      "pinyin": "duān wǔ jié shì zhōng guó de yí ge chuán tǒng jié rì qǐ yuán yú chūn qiū zhī qián de wú yuè zhī dì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "农历五月初五这里的人们以龙舟竞赛的形式举行部落图腾祭祀活动。",
      "traditional": "農曆五月初五這裡的人們以龍舟競賽的形式舉行部落圖騰祭祀活動。",
      "pinyin": "nóng lì wǔ yuè chū wǔ zhè lǐ de rén men yǐ lóng zhōu jìng sài de xíng shì jǔ xíng bù luò tú téng jì sì huó dòng",
      "english": "The Dragon Boat Festival is a traditional festival of China that originated in the land of Wu Yue before the Spring and Autumn period."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "后来，爱国诗人屈原投汨罗江而死，",
      "traditional": "後來，愛國詩人屈原投汨羅江而死，",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái ài guó shī rén qū yuán tóu mì luó jiāng ér sǐ",
      "english": "People there worshiped the tribal totem by holding dragon boat racing contests every May 5th in the lunar calendar."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "传说人们为了保护他的尸体便做粽子投入江中喂食鱼虫。",
      "traditional": "傳說人們為了保護他的屍體便做粽子投入江中餵食魚蟲。",
      "pinyin": "chuán shuō rén men wèi le bǎo hù tā de shī tǐ biàn zuò zòng zi tóu rù jiāng zhōng wèi shí yú chóng",
      "english": "Later on, Qu Yuan who was a patriotic poet died in the MiLuo River."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "因此, 这天成为纪念屈原的日子。",
      "traditional": "因此, 這天成為紀念屈原的日子。",
      "pinyin": "yīn cǐ zhè tiān chéng wéi jì niàn qū yuán de rì zi",
      "english": "It is said that the after Qu Yuan's death people threw Zongzi into the river to feed fish in order to protect Qu Yuan’s corpse."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Hence, May 5th became the day people commemorate him by eating Zongzi."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "端午节的时候，人们喜欢吃粽子，喝雄黄酒，赛龙舟，",
      "traditional": "端午節的時候，人們喜歡吃粽子，喝雄黃酒，賽龍舟，",
      "pinyin": "duān wǔ jié de shí hou rén men xǐ huan chī zòng zi hē xióng huáng jiǔ sài lóng zhōu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "还会挂菖蒲和蒿草。",
      "traditional": "還會掛菖蒲和蒿草。",
      "pinyin": "hái huì guà chāng pú hé hāo cǎo",
      "english": "During the Dragon Boat Festival, people like eating Zongzi, drinking realgar wine, holding dragon boat racing contests, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "吃粽子是最常见的方式，",
      "traditional": "吃粽子是最常見的方式，",
      "pinyin": "chī zòng zi shì zuì cháng jiàn de fāng shì",
      "english": ".. and hanging calamus and wormwood."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "但中国的北方和南方吃的粽子种类不一样。",
      "traditional": "但中國的北方和南方吃的粽子種類不一樣。",
      "pinyin": "dàn zhōng guó de běi fāng hé nán fāng chī de zòng zi zhǒng lèi bù yí yàng",
      "english": "Eating Zongzi is the most common form of celebration on this day, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "北方人经常吃甜粽，里面包的有红枣，豆沙等，",
      "traditional": "北方人經常吃甜粽，裡面包的有紅棗，豆沙等，",
      "pinyin": "běi fāng rén jīng cháng chī tián zòng lǐ miàn bāo de yǒu hóng zǎo dòu shā děng",
      "english": ".. but the people in north and south China eat different kinds of Zongzi."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "而南方人更喜欢吃肉粽，里面包的是鲜肉。",
      "traditional": "而南方人更喜歡吃肉粽，裡面包的是鮮肉。",
