    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Dragon Boat Festival",
      "",
      "The Dragon Boat Festival is a traditional festival of China that originated in the land of Wu Yue before the Spring and Autumn period.",
      "People there worshiped the tribal totem by holding dragon boat racing contests every May 5th in the lunar calendar.",
      "Later on, Qu Yuan who was a patriotic poet died in the MiLuo River.",
      "It is said that the after Qu Yuan's death people threw Zongzi into the river to feed fish in order to protect Qu Yuan’s corpse.",
      "Hence, May 5th became the day people commemorate him by eating Zongzi.",
      "",
      "During the Dragon Boat Festival, people like eating Zongzi, drinking realgar wine, holding dragon boat racing contests, ..",
      ".. and hanging calamus and wormwood.",
      "Eating Zongzi is the most common form of celebration on this day, ..",
      ".. but the people in north and south China eat different kinds of Zongzi.",
      "People in north China often eat sweet Zongzi wrapped with red date or bean paste, etc, ..",
      ".. but people in south China prefer eating meat Zongzi wrapped with fresh meat.",
      ""
    ]
